    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚠️ #6 (yellow) — Twilio signature\nBefore going live, validate `X-Twilio-Signature` on this webhook so nobody can forge an 'accept'. Add a Code/Crypto check right after the Webhook node using your Twilio Auth Token.\n\n## Green (already wired)\n- #5 payload decode `accept:<id>` / `reject:<id>`\n- #7 server-side `UPDATE` via Postgres role (bypasses RLS)\n- #8 idempotency: `WHERE status IN ('new','viewed')` + 'first decision wins' gate\n- #4 phone → E.164 for the wa.me link",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "bccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc",
      "name": "Notes",
